.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rev-stealth-captcha-solve 1  "rev-stealth-captcha-solve " 
.SH NAME
rev\-stealth\-captcha\-solve \- Solve a CAPTCHA challenge
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrev\-stealth captcha solve\fR <\fB\-\-type\fR> <\fB\-\-site\-url\fR> [\fB\-\-site\-key\fR] [\fB\-\-action\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Solve a CAPTCHA challenge by delegating to the configured captcha\-bypass solver. Supports reCAPTCHA v2/v3, hCaptcha, and Turnstile. Token output is JSON when \-\-format=json. AUTHORIZED TARGETS ONLY.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<TYPE>\fR
Challenge type: `recaptcha\-v2`, `recaptcha\-v3`, `hcaptcha`, `turnstile`
.TP
\fB\-\-site\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
Target site URL hosting the challenge
.TP
\fB\-\-site\-key\fR \fI<KEY>\fR
Sitekey (auto\-detected if omitted on supported challenge types)
.TP
\fB\-\-action\fR \fI<ACTION>\fR [default: submit]
reCAPTCHA v3 action label
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Skip the live solver and exercise the sidecar plumbing only. Useful for CI smoke tests
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  $ rev\-stealth captcha solve \-\-type recaptcha\-v2 \-\-site\-url https://example.com
  $ rev\-stealth captcha solve \-\-type turnstile \-\-site\-url https://x.test \-\-site\-key 0x4 \-\-dry\-run
  $ rev\-stealth \-\-format json captcha solve \-\-type hcaptcha \-\-site\-url https://h.test

EXIT CODES:
  0  Ok               Token solved successfully.
  1  UserError        Bad args (unknown \-\-type, malformed \-\-site\-url).
  2  TransientError   Solver network/provider transient failure.
  3  PermanentError   Solver not configured or challenge unsupported.

ENV:
  REV_STEALTH_CAPTCHA_SECRET  Provider secret used by `verify` (see captcha verify \-\-help).
